{"base_rate":0.3938506588579795,"brier":0.18257672035139091,"bss":0.2352241105903058,"bss_hi":0.3474818627059342,"bss_lo":0.10244599889052611,"chart":{"base":[572.7,64.7],"fp":[206.7,252.2],"lead":"62,263.4 272,249.9 482,230.7 692,210.5","note":{"base":"skill 0.24 — higher than 35% of cities","fp":"low end +1pp, high end +27pp","lead":"day-1 error 1.0 °C — better than 69% of cities","rel":"promised 0% → rained 2%; promised 97% → rained 77%"},"rel":"63.8,456.4 172.4,409.7 476.2,354 675.8,131.4"},"country":"MO","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve","Seasonal split"],"ece":0.17199121522693997,"ess":262.9294951070318,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Macau</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Macau rain forecast is moderately skilful, though 5 points on its probability scale are off by more than chance explains.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (100%), believe about\n<b>85%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(0%), there is still roughly a <b>2%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 683 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-03-25. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nthe station, 7.4 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score 0.24, ranked 138 of\n213 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(80&ndash;174) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>0%</td><td class='num'><b>2%</b></td><td class='num'>135</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>8%</td><td class='num'><b>7%</b></td><td class='num'>68</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>26%</td><td class='num'><b>19%</b></td><td class='num'>70</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>54%</td><td class='num'><b>27%</b></td><td class='num'>67</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>77%</td><td class='num'><b>25%</b></td><td class='num'>68</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>91%</td><td class='num'><b>55%</b></td><td class='num'>67</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>100%</td><td class='num'><b>85%</b></td><td class='num'>208</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">5 of 7 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Macau</b> <span class=\"muted\">Macau</span></p>\n  <p class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Moderately skilful</span>\n    <span class=\"muted\">5 points off by more than chance</span></p>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score</dt><dd>0.24</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>80&ndash;174\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 213</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>683 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Macau &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Macau\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"58\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">0%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"146.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"146.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"291.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"291.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"146.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">25%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"235.0\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"200.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"200.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"204.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">50%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"323.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"323.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"109.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"109.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"323.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">75%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">75%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"412\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"412\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">100%</text><polygon class=\"chart-band\" points=\"58.99644444444444,376.60740740740744 87.56941176470588,323.11764705882354 151.60771428571428,246.79999999999998 248.89582089552243,142.955223880597 331.9335294117647,66.1764705882353 378.8191044776119,28.86567164179104 410.6214423076923,18.0 410.6214423076923,23.25 378.8191044776119,77.76119402985074 331.9335294117647,135.76470588235293 248.89582089552243,229.88059701492537 151.60771428571428,319.6 87.56941176470588,371.29411764705884 58.99644444444444,382.0\" opacity=\"0.16\"/><line class=\"chart-ideal\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,4\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line class=\"chart-base\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"238.63836017569545\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"238.63836017569545\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"58.99644444444444,373.9111111111111 87.56941176470588,355.2352941176471 151.60771428571428,314.4 248.89582089552243,284.2089552238806 331.9335294117647,291.0 378.8191044776119,180.98507462686567 410.6214423076923,74.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 0%&amp;#10;It rained 2% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 135 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"58.99644444444444\" cy=\"373.9111111111111\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 8%&amp;#10;It rained 7% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 68 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"87.56941176470588\" cy=\"355.2352941176471\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 26%&amp;#10;It rained 19% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 70 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"151.60771428571428\" cy=\"314.4\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 54%&amp;#10;It rained 27% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 67 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"248.89582089552243\" cy=\"284.2089552238806\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 77%&amp;#10;It rained 25% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 68 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"331.9335294117647\" cy=\"291.0\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 91%&amp;#10;It rained 55% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 67 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"378.8191044776119\" cy=\"180.98507462686567\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 100%&amp;#10;It rained 85% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 208 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"410.6214423076923\" cy=\"74.0\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(39%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Macau the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>spring</b> (0.25) and least in\n<b>summer</b> (-0.00).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>179</td><td class='num'>65%</td><td class='num'>-0.002</td><td class='num'>23.5%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>178</td><td class='num'>33%</td><td class='num'>0.094</td><td class='num'>20.4%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>175</td><td class='num'>17%</td><td class='num'>0.138</td><td class='num'>7.0%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>151</td><td class='num'>43%</td><td class='num'>0.249</td><td class='num'>17.6%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":22.20056,"lon":113.54611,"n":683,"n_cities":213,"name":"Macau","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.03,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.0028148148148148147,"n":135,"obs":0.022222222222222223,"sig":true},{"hi":0.16,"lo":0.03,"mean":0.08352941176470588,"n":68,"obs":0.07352941176470588,"sig":false},{"hi":0.39800000000000013,"lo":0.16,"mean":0.26442857142857146,"n":70,"obs":0.18571428571428572,"sig":false},{"hi":0.69,"lo":0.39800000000000013,"mean":0.5392537313432837,"n":67,"obs":0.26865671641791045,"sig":true},{"hi":0.85,"lo":0.69,"mean":0.7738235294117647,"n":68,"obs":0.25,"sig":true},{"hi":0.97,"lo":0.85,"mean":0.9062686567164178,"n":67,"obs":0.5522388059701493,"sig":true},{"hi":1.0,"lo":0.97,"mean":0.9961057692307692,"n":208,"obs":0.8461538461538461,"sig":true}],"prcp_km":7.4,"provisional":false,"rank":138,"rank_hi":174.0,"rank_lo":79.975,"reliability":0.05436379159649768,"resolution":0.11031406419688765,"skill_pct":null,"slug":"macau","station":"","timezone":"Asia/Macau"}